---
import { path } from '../lib/path';
---

<section class="teaser">
  <div class="container teaser-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Our Philosophy</p>
    <blockquote data-reveal style="--stagger: 1">
      The edge isn&rsquo;t sharper analysis &mdash; it&rsquo;s staying clear,
      and acting decisively, when pressure peaks.
    </blockquote>
    <p class="body" data-reveal style="--stagger: 2">
      Gold is traded actively and split across several independent hands, so no
      single trader&rsquo;s nerve decides the outcome under stress. Digital
      assets are bought outright, without leverage, so no position can be
      closed out from under us in the moment that matters most. The structure
      exists to keep decisions clear when conditions are not.
    </p>
    <a href={path('/strategy')} class="link-arrow">Read our approach</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .teaser {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(44px, 7vh, 80px) 0;
  }
  .teaser-inner > * { max-width: 760px; }

  blockquote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.6vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.22;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 20px 0 28px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .body {
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.2vw, 17px);
    line-height: 1.72;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }
</style>
